1
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:04,412
This drive has it all!

2
00:00:04,412 --> 00:00:07,401
Giant red rock towers you can visit for free.

3
00:00:07,401 --> 00:00:09,926
A one-lane road on a razor-thin ridge.

4
00:00:09,926 --> 00:00:15,640
And America's highest suspension bridge, nine hundred fifty-five feet above the river!

5
00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:24,476
This is Colorado Springs to the Royal Gorge: 66 miles from Garden of the Gods to one of the most famous bridges in America.

6
00:00:24,476 --> 00:00:27,810
Stick around till the end for the full trip planner!

7
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,795
Here's the plan!

8
00:00:29,795 --> 00:00:37,560
We start at Garden of the Gods, stop in Manitou Springs, head south to Cañon City, and finish at the Royal Gorge Bridge!

9
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:40,954
We're starting at Garden of the Gods!

10
00:00:40,954 --> 00:00:45,909
Giant red rock towers, Pikes Peak right behind them, and it's totally free.

11
00:00:45,909 --> 00:00:49,080
Walk the paved loop and check out Balanced Rock!

12
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:54,830
Past Balanced Rock, and just down the hill into Manitou Springs!

13
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:57,495
Welcome to Manitou Springs!

14
00:00:57,495 --> 00:01:05,560
Taste the natural mineral springs around town, and if you have time, ride the cog railway all the way to the top of Pikes Peak!

15
00:01:06,510 --> 00:01:14,350
South on Highway 115, past Cheyenne Mountain and out into the open country, all the way to Cañon City!

16
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:16,817
Welcome to Cañon City!

17
00:01:16,817 --> 00:01:25,985
Don't miss Skyline Drive, a one-lane road right along the top of a razor-thin ridge, built with prison labor back in the early 1900s.

18
00:01:25,985 --> 00:01:26,950
Hold on tight!

19
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:31,682
West on US 50, then up to the rim of the gorge.

20
00:01:31,682 --> 00:01:32,970
And there it is!

21
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:41,380
This is the Royal Gorge Bridge, America's highest suspension bridge, nine hundred fifty-five feet above the Arkansas River!

22
00:01:41,380 --> 00:01:44,777
Walk across it, and look straight down through the gaps.

23
00:01:44,777 --> 00:01:45,080
Whoa!

24
00:01:46,030 --> 00:01:47,710
And that's the drive!

25
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:52,430
66 miles from Garden of the Gods to the Royal Gorge Bridge.

26
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:56,540
Here's your trip planner, everything in one place.

27
00:01:56,540 --> 00:01:58,310
Pause and grab a screenshot!

28
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:03,526
Thanks for riding along!

29
00:02:03,526 --> 00:02:09,220
Hit subscribe, and next time we're heading to Arizona, for the red rocks of Sedona!
